<title>USA: Lilly Industries inks technology swap pact.</title>
<headline>Lilly Industries inks technology swap pact.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lilly Industries Inc said Thursday it signed a technology exchange agreement with Sigma Coatings Group, a unit of Petrofina SA, covering coil coatings.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not announced.</p>
<p>The company said the agreement will give both companies access to additional coil coatings technologies through joint research and development programs.</p>
<p>Lilly Industries makes industrial coatings and specialty chemical products.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading up 5/8 Thursday at 19-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
